promptTemplate:
生成网关路由。mode=private；host=svc.internal；ports 按顺序为 443、8443；如果 schema 要求 auth，则 scheme=mtls，ca=ca/内网.pem。不得遗漏 Schema 条件字段。
输出必须遵循这个 Schema：{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"mode":{"enum":["public","private"]},"host":{"type":"string"},"auth":{"type":"object","properties":{"scheme":{"const":"mtls"},"ca":{"type":"string"}},"required":["scheme","ca"],"additionalProperties":false},"ports":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"integer"},"minItems":1,"uniqueItems":true}},"required":["mode","host","ports"],"allOf":[{"if":{"properties":{"mode":{"const":"private"}},"required":["mode"]},"then":{"required":["auth"]},"else":{"not":{"required":["auth"]}}}],"unevaluatedProperties":false}
只输出完整 JSON 原文，不要围栏或解释。对象键序不限。响应最多 131072 个字符。

生成递归树，根是 group，name="根"。根的第一个孩子是 leaf，name="a/b~c"，value=null；第二个是 group，name="nested"，它恰有一个 leaf 孩子，name="empty"，value=""。保留 null 和空串，禁止简化树。
输出必须遵循这个 Schema：{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","$ref":"#/$defs/node","$defs":{"node":{"oneOf":[{"type":"object","properties":{"kind":{"const":"leaf"},"name":{"type":"string"},"value":{"type":["string","null"]}},"required":["kind","name","value"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"object","properties":{"kind":{"const":"group"},"name":{"type":"string"},"children":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/node"}}},"required":["kind","name","children"],"additionalProperties":false}]}}}
只输出完整 JSON 原文，不要围栏或解释。对象键序不限。响应最多 131072 个字符。

生成 headers 对象，只有 x-note、x-empty、x-enabled。x-note 对字符串 "a/b 空" 按 UTF-8 百分号编码：仅 ASCII 字母数字和 -._~ 不编码，十六进制大写，空格是 %20；x-empty 是空串；x-enabled 是布尔 false。
输出必须遵循这个 Schema：{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"headers":{"type":"object","properties":{"x-note":{"type":"string"},"x-empty":{"type":"string"},"x-enabled":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["x-note","x-empty","x-enabled"],"additionalProperties":false}},"required":["headers"],"additionalProperties":false}
只输出完整 JSON 原文，不要围栏或解释。对象键序不限。响应最多 131072 个字符。

输出仅包含键 "registry/a~b" 的注册中心对象。其 type="npm-registry"，url="https://registry.example.test"。先把 inputText 的 JSON 字符串字面量解析为原文，构造 {"note":原文}，按 JavaScript JSON.stringify 的默认行为序列化一次后把结果作为 token 字符串值（中文原样保留，无额外空白）。这是虚构字符串保真测试，不是实际认证信息。不得增加字段。inputText="\"quoted\"\\slash\n${{data}}"

必须同时遵循以下 JSON Schema 和上面的内容规则；可省略的字段按题面决定。对象键序不限。只输出一个完整 JSON 值，不要围栏或解释。
{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","additionalProperties":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"type":{"enum":["cargo-registry","composer-repository","docker-registry","git","goproxy-server","hex-organization","hex-repository","helm-registry","maven-repository","npm-registry","nuget-feed","pub-repository","python-index","rubygems-server","terraform-registry"]},"url":{"type":"string"},"username":{"type":"string"},"password":{"type":"string"},"key":{"type":"string"},"token":{"type":"string"},"replaces-base":{"type":"boolean"},"scope":{"oneOf":[{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"uniqueItems":true,"minItems":1},{"type":"string","minLength":1}]},"organization":{"type":"string"},"repo":{"type":"string"},"auth-key":{"type":"string"},"public-key-fingerprint":{"type":"string"},"registry":{"type":"string"},"tenant-id":{"type":"string"},"client-id":{"type":"string"},"jfrog-oidc-provider-name":{"type":"string"},"identity-mapping-name":{"type":"string"},"audience":{"type":"string"},"aws-region":{"type":"string"},"account-id":{"type":"string"},"role-name":{"type":"string"},"domain":{"type":"string"},"domain-owner":{"type":"string"}},"required":["type","url"]},"minProperties":1}

输出仅包含键 "registry/a~b" 的注册中心对象。其 type="npm-registry"，url="https://registry.example.test"。先把 inputText 的 JSON 字符串字面量解析为原文，构造 {"note":原文}，按 JavaScript JSON.stringify 的默认行为序列化一次后把结果作为 token 字符串值（中文原样保留，无额外空白）。这是虚构字符串保真测试，不是实际认证信息。不得增加字段。inputText="用户名=\"甲\"\r\n路径=C:\\temp\\秘密"

必须同时遵循以下 JSON Schema 和上面的内容规则；可省略的字段按题面决定。对象键序不限。只输出一个完整 JSON 值，不要围栏或解释。
